{'symbol': 'DOW', 'date': '2023-05-22 09:00:00', 'title': 'DOW TO PARTICIPATE IN THE BERNSTEIN 39TH ANNUAL STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE', 'text': 'MIDLAND, MICH. , MAY 22, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JIM FITTERLING , CHAIRMAN AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF DOW\xa0INC. (NYSE: DOW), WILL PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT DURING THE BERNSTEIN 39TH ANNUAL STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE ON WEDNESDAY, MAY 31 AT 2:30 P.M.'}